diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..eca528e14
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Commas inside regular expressions are no longer treated as separators in options
+taking a comma-separated list of regular expressions (e.g. ``bad-names-rgxs``).
+Commas in quantifiers such as ``{1,3}`` and in character classes such as ``[,;]``
+are now preserved, and a comma can be escaped with a backslash (``\,``).
+
+Closes #7229
